  "selection": "The v1 subset is reconstructed from pinned upstream order and verified against its frozen input, gold, and selected-ID hashes. The v2 subset is reconstructed using its frozen SHA256(seed + source_question_id) ranking and verified against its frozen input, gold, and selected-ID hashes. For v3, the two lowest SHA256(seed + source_question_id) ranks among records outside both prior sets are selected for each v1 category quota: two answerable in each of six types and two abstentions in the four types that had abstentions in v1. Rank ties use source question ID. Output case IDs are assigned after sorting by type, status (abstention before answerable), then rank and source ID. Session IDs and dates remain zipped by index with sessions. Input excludes answer/evidence markers, source question IDs, and gold labels; gold is a separate evaluator-only file.",
